  "notes": "A compound verb from {付|つ}ける (to attach) + {加|くわ}える (to add). Commonly used in speeches, presentations, and writing when supplementing an explanation or argument.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{一言|ひとこと}{付|つ}け{加|くわ}える (add a word)\n・{補足|ほそく}を{付|つ}け{加|くわ}える (add a supplement)\n・{情報|じょうほう}を{付|つ}け{加|くわ}える (add information)\n・{条件|じょうけん}を{付|つ}け{加|くわ}える (add a condition)",
